#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Inföhren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&dolphin; is a file manager for &kde; which aims to improve usability at "
#| "the user interface level. &dolphin; is not intended to be a competitor to "
#| "&konqueror;. &dolphin; focuses only on being a file manager whereas "
#| "&konqueror; is a universal viewer of many file types. This development "
#| "approach allows for concentrating on optimizing the user interface for "
#| "the specific task of file management."
msgid ""
"&dolphin; is &kde;'s default file manager. It aims to improve usability at "
"the user interface level. &dolphin; focuses only on being a file manager "
"whereas &konqueror;, which was &kde;'s default file manager in &kde; 3 and "
"can still be used for file management, is a universal viewer for many file "
"types."
msgstr ""
"&dolphin; is en Dateipleger för &kde;, de de Bruukborkeit över de Böversiet "
"verbetern will. &dolphin; schall keen Konkurangs to &konqueror; wesen. "
"&dolphin; schall bloots en Dateipleger wesen, bides &konqueror; en "
"Universaalkieker för vele Dateitypen is. Dit Vörgahn bi't Utwickeln maakt "
"dat mööglich, wi maakt toeerst de Böversiet beter för de Opgaven, de bi't "
"Plegen vun Dateien so anfallt."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This development approach allows for concentrating on optimizing the user "
"interface for the specific task of file management."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Please report any problems or feature requests to the &dolphin; author "
